(window.BOOK_MODULES = window.BOOK_MODULES || {})[12] = {"n": 12, "title": "Genitive Noun Roles and Dependent Words", "ar": "المَجْرُورَاتُ وَالتَّوَابِعُ", "lessons": [{"key": "0", "title": "Introduction", "short": "Introduction", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s1\">Before you begin</h2><p>An ending is evidence; a relationship explains it. First identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>, then decide whether a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول بالأصالة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول بالتبعية</span>. Finally give its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامته</span>.</p><p>Recall <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر، مضاف، مضاف إليه، فاعل، مفعول به، مبتدأ، خبر، معرفة، نكرة، ضمير متصل، ضمير منفصل، ضمير مستتر</span></b>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق</span></b> has a related <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> meaning; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد</span></b> does not have that formation. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظ</span></b> concerns the expressed wording; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span></b> concerns its grammatical place. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span></b> is what is asserted; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span></b> is evidence that determines the intended reading.</p><p>Useful endings: a regular <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة للرفع، فتحة للنصب، كسرة للجر</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف للرفع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء للنصب والجر</span>; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مذكر سالم</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو للرفع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء للنصب والجر</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> retains its form; identify its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> where it has one.</p><p>The five <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التوابع</span> are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النعت، البدل، عطف البيان، المعطوف بحرف العطف، التأكيد</span></b>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابع</span> receives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> through its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span>. They can follow <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعات، منصوبات</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورات</span>; they are not all <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورات</span>.</p><p>Work through guided choices, then less-vowelled unfamiliar examples. Each question or table row has one correct choice. Where several analyses are possible, the question specifies the one to use. Give the reason before checking the answer.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L0-s1", "title": "Before you begin"}], "items": []}, {"key": "1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجرور</span> and the reason for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>", "short": "Lesson 1", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s1\">Two routes</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجرور بحرف الجر</span></b> follows a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيتِ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجرور بالإضافة</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بابُ البيتِ</span></b>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> may itself be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورًا</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضافًا</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في بيتِ خالدٍ</span></b>.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأملتُ بابَ البيتِ. جلستُ في البيتِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I examined the door of the house. I sat in the house.</span></div><p>The first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>; the second is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بفي</span>. Both have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>, but their relationships differ. Terms: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالإضافة</span></b> = through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظًا</span></b> = in the expressed form; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محلًّا</span></b> = in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل إعراب</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s2\">Do not confuse meaning with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span></h2><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ستةِ أيامٍ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيام</span> specifies the number: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> in meaning, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالإضافة</span> in the detailed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>. It is not a third independent route to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>.</p><p>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر زائد</span></b> can produce <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر لفظي</span> while the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعًا</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوبًا محلًّا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاءَ من رجلٍ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل فاعل مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما رأيتُ من رجلٍ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل مفعول به مجرور لفظًا منصوب محلًّا. زائد</span> is a grammatical label, not a claim that the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> contributes nothing.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلستُ في بيتِ خالدٍ</span>.</b></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلسْتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلس فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل؛ التاء ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيتِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بفي بالكسرة، وهو مضاف</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في بيت خالد</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور متعلّق بجلست. خالد</span> is not directly <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورًا بفي</span>.</li></ul><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يكون</span></b> = may be.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L1-s1", "title": "Two routes"}, {"id": "L1-s2", "title": "Do not confuse meaning with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>"}, {"id": "L1-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "1G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> to the reason for its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت</span></b> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالحرف</span>; after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب</span> it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيام</span></b> specifies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ستة</span> but its detailed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>. The meaning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> does not introduce a third route to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلست في البيتِ: البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بحرف الجر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مجرور لفظًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت بابَ البيتِ: البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت لباب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور برأيت</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ستةِ أيامٍ: أيام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بفي مباشرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز العدد مجرور بالإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب بالكسرة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "1G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلستُ في بيتِ خالدٍ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلسْتُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون والتاء في محل رفع فاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيتِ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بفي بالكسرة ومضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة. الجار والمجرور متعلّق بجلست</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> does not directly extend to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جلستُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم والتاء مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون، والتاء فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل غير عامل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بفي بالكسرة، وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لخالد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت مجرور</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في بيت خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور متعلّق بجلست</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة مستقلة بلا عامل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "1I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما رأيت من طائرٍ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طائر</span> = bird.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر زائد؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طائرٍ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به مجرور لفظًا بمن، منصوب محلًّا</span>. The relation to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت</span> determines <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب المحل</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طائر مضاف إليه لرأيت</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طائر مفعول به مجرور لفظًا منصوب محلًّا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طائر فاعل مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نظرتُ إلى بابِ <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b> with the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسجد</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسجدِ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة. باب</span> is itself <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بإلى</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>. The nested relationships are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسجد</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسجدِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسجدُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسجدَ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "1R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من رجلٍ</span></b> analysed differently in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء من رجلٍ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما رأيت من رجلٍ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>In the first, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع محلًّا</span>; in the second, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب محلًّا</span>. Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لفظًا بمن الزائدة</span>. Establish the relationship before naming the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.</p>", "group": "1R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span> makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل فاعلًا</span> in both.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل فاعل في الأولى ومفعول به في الثانية، مع جر لفظي فيهما</span>.", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل مضافًا إليه</span> in both."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يكون الاسم مجرورًا لفظًا مرفوعًا محلًّا</span>.</b> Which example illustrates this?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٍ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا. بيت</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span> have ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> relationships; neither is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع محلًّا</span> in those examples.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دخلت في بيتٍ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت كتابَ خالدٍ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما جاء من رجلٍ، ومن زائدة</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النعت الحقيقي</span> and the forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>", "short": "Lesson 2", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s1\">A description of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النعت</span></b> is also called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span></b>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوف</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت حقيقي</span></b> describes a meaning in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span> itself. In its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق</span> form, its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر</span> referring to that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span>.</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ رجلٌ مؤمنٌ. رأيتُ الرجلَ المؤمنَ. مررتُ بالرجلِ المؤمنِ</span>.</b></div><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النعت الحقيقي</span> follows its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span> in four dimensions: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب؛ تعريف أو تنكير؛ تذكير أو تأنيث؛ إفراد أو تثنية أو جمع</span></b>. First choose the role of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span>; then carry the appropriate agreement into the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>. Matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> does not necessarily mean using an identical written ending.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق</span> or what functions like it</h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق بمعنى الفعل</span> or resembles such a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق</span>. Recognise these forms rather than restricting <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> to words such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صالح</span>:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Form</th><th>Example and reading</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ مؤمنٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بقميصي هذا: هذا = المشار إليه، نعت في محل جر</span> in this account</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو وفروعه</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ ذو علمٍ: ذو = صاحب؛ ذو نعت مرفوع بالواو، علم مضاف إليه</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر غير ميمي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدمٍ كذبٍ: كذب بمعنى كاذب؛ الوصف بالمصدر</span> adds force</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم منسوب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ عربيٌّ</span>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المشددة</span> marks <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نسبة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول مبدوء بهمزة الوصل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجلُ الذي حضرَ: الذي نعت؛</span> this category excludes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَنْ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم عدد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في ظلماتٍ ثلاثٍ: ثلاث نعت مجرور</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The ordinary agreement pattern is clearest with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتقات</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا</span> follows in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> used descriptively retains its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> form. Do not mechanically manufacture an ending or a new form for every example.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ الطالبَيْنِ المجتهدَيْنِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I saw the two diligent students.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبين</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالياء لأنه مثنّى</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجتهدين</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت حقيقي منصوب بالياء لأنه مثنّى؛</span> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبين</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب، تعريف، تذكير</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تثنية</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> does not become a second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتبع</span></b> = follows. Recall all four dimensions of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المطابقة</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L2-s1", "title": "A description of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span>"}, {"id": "L2-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق</span> or what functions like it"}, {"id": "L2-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "2G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify the form functioning as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> in the stated account.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤمن</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة</span> interpreted as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشار إليه</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت في محل جر</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كذب</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر غير ميمي بمعنى كاذب</span> with an emphatic descriptive force; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عربيّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم منسوب</span>. These are different forms serving a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> relationship.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل مؤمن: مؤمن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بقميصي هذا: هذا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة في محل جر نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لقميص</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدم كذب: كذب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر غير ميمي بمعنى كاذب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل عربي: عربي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم منسوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "2G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ الطالبين المجتهدين</span></b> as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> construction.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبَيْنِ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالياء لأنه مثنّى؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجتهدَيْنِ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت حقيقي منصوب بالياء لأنه مثنّى</span>. It follows its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span> in all four stated dimensions; the shared <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> is not a reason to call both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعولًا به</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المجتهدين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت مرفوع بالواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به ثان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت حقيقي منصوب بالياء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المطابقة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب وتعريف وتذكير وتثنية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب فقط بلا مطابقة أخرى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر وتنكير وتأنيث وجمع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "2I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلّمتُ على المعلّمتين <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت حقيقي</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صالحة</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصالحتين</span></b> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمتين</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر، تعريف، تأنيث</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تثنية</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالياء</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصالحين</span> fails <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span>, while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصالحتان</span> fails <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصالحتَيْنِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصالحتانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصالحَيْنِ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "2I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the correct analysis of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ ذو علمٍ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو</span></b> has the meaning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب</span> and functions as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>. It is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالواو</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمٍ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> inside the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> does not erase its relationship to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو حرف جر؛ علم فاعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو مفعول به منصوب؛ علم نعت مرفوع</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو نعت مرفوع بالواو ومضاف؛ علم مضاف إليه</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "2R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which list consists entirely of forms allowed in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> categories taught?", "sol": "<p>The taught categories include the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span> beginning with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الوصل</span> such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي</span></b>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو وفروعه</span></b>, and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء العدد</span></b>. This <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الموصول</span> category specifically excludes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَنْ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>.</p>", "group": "2R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفعل الماضي، حرف الجر، ضمير الفاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَنْ، ما، حرف الجر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي، ذو، اسم العدد</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "2-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النعت الحقيقي يتبع متبوعه في إعرابه وتعريفه أو تنكيره</span>.</b> What must also be checked?", "sol": "<p>For ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق نعت حقيقي</span>, check all four dimensions. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا</span> follows in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> and cannot be given a manufactured changing ending.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> must always be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوبًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التذكير أو التأنيث، والإفراد أو التثنية أو الجمع</span>.", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> must always have the same written ending, even when <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيًّا</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النعت السببي</span> and an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span>", "short": "Lesson 3", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s1\">Describe something connected to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي</span></b> describes a meaning in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعلّق المتبوع</span></b>, something connected with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span> after it. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ برجلٍ صالحٍ</span></b> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ برجلٍ صالحٍ أبوهُ</span></b>: the second attributes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلاح</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبوه</span>.</p><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي</span> follows the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف أو تنكير</span></b>. Do not copy the entire four-part <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حقيقي</span> pattern. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من هذه القريةِ الظالمِ أهلُها</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الظالم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> like <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القرية</span>, but not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنثًا</span> like it: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أهل</span> is the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p><p>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير عائد إلى المنعوت</span></b> supplies the connection: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبوه</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ها</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أهلها</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span></b> can stand in place of that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> in the special construction <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شديد العقاب</span></b>, understood as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شديد عقابه</span></b>. Do not treat every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> as a substitute for a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بالرجلِ الصالحِ أبوهُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I passed the man whose father is righteous.</span></div><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصالح</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي مجرور بالكسرة، معرفة مثل منعوته</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبو</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل للصالح مرفوع بالواو، وهو مضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه، عائد إلى الرجل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> relates to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت؛</span> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> describe the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span> relationship.</li></ul></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> and a change of position</h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span> can be omitted and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> take its place: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعملوا صالحًا</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعملوا عملًا صالحًا</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صالحًا</span> stands for the omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span> in this analysis; do not invent an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span>.</p><p>When a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> is brought before it in the relevant construction, analyse it as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ رجلٌ راكبٌ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ راكبًا رجلٌ</span></b>. The change affects the relationship and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>, not just word order. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكب</span></b> = riding.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدل على</span></b> = indicates; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعلّق</span></b> = something connected with it.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L3-s1", "title": "Describe something connected to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span> and a change of position"}], "items": [{"id": "3G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حقيقي</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سببي</span> by where the description applies.", "sol": "<p>In the first, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صالح</span></b> describes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> directly. In the second it raises <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبوه</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span> connects that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span>. This is the defining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سببي</span> relationship.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت برجل صالح: صالح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي؛ الصلاح لاسم ظاهر بعده</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت حقيقي؛ الصلاح للرجل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت برجل صالح أبوه: صالح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي؛ الصلاح لأبيه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت حقيقي؛ أبوه مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت برجل صالح أبوه: الهاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد إلى المنعوت رجل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد إلى صالح وحده</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "3G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بالرجلِ الصالحِ أبوهُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل؛ الباء حرف جر والرجل مجرور</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصالح</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي مجرور، يوافق الرجل في جر وتعريف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبو</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل للصالح مرفوع بالواو ومضاف؛ الهاء مضاف إليه عائد إلى الرجل. الجار والمجرور متعلّق بمررت</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع والتاء مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالباء بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصالح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي مجرور بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت حقيقي مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبو</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالباء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به للصالح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل للصالح مرفوع بالواو وهو مضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه يعود إلى الرجل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر زائد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل للصالح</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "3I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من هذه القريةِ الظالمِ أهلُها</span></b>, why is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الظالم</span> not changed to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الظالمة</span> merely to match <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القرية</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الظالمِ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي مجرور معرفة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أهلُ</span></b> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ها</span> refers to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القرية</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حقيقي</span> four-part copying rule cannot be applied mechanically to this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سببي</span> construction.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو نعت حقيقي يجب أن يخالف منعوته دائمًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو نعت سببي؛ فاعله أهل، ويتبع القرية في الجر والتعريف</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القرية مذكر لأن قبلها من</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "3I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Change <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء رجلٌ راكبٌ</span></b> by bringing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكب</span> before the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> in the taught <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span> construction.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكبًا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب بالفتحة</span> after the change; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلًا مرفوعًا</span>. It is not simply a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> whose position changed without a change in analysis.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء راكبًا رجلٌ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء راكبٍ رجلٌ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء راكبٌ رجلٌ، وراكب نعت مقدّم</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "3R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعملوا عملًا صالحًا</span></b> to analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعملوا صالحًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عملًا</span></b>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صالحًا</span></b> takes its place in the shortened wording. Distinguish what is expressed from what is supplied by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>.</p>", "group": "3R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف المنعوت وأقيم النعت مقامه؛ صالحًا يقوم مقام المفعول المطلق</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عملًا اسم ظاهر مكتوب في الجملة المختصرة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صالحًا مضاف إليه مجرور لفظًا</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "3-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النعت السببي يدل على معنى في متعلّق متبوعه</span>.</b> Which explanation fits <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شديد العقاب</span></b> understood as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شديد عقابه</span>?", "sol": "<p>In this particular construction <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span></b> stands in place of the returning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شديد عقابه</span></b>. This does not make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> in every occurrence.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل أل في العربية ضمير فاعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل تقوم مقام الضمير العائد في هذه الصيغة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا صلة بين العقاب والمنعوت</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "4", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البدل</span> and its four types", "short": "Lesson 4", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s1\">The intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البدل تابع بلا واسطة حرف عطف، مقصود بالحكم</span>.</b> The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span> is directed to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبدل منه</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلا واسطة</span></b> means without an intervening <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>. Establish the intended relationship before choosing a label.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>Meaning</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل، البدل المطابق، بدل العين من العين</span></td><td>Both expressions refer to the same thing</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أخوك خالدٌ،</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مقصودًا بالحكم</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل البعض</span></td><td>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> is an actual part of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبدل منه</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ الكتابَ نصفَهُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الاشتمال</span></td><td>An associated matter, not an actual part</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعجبني خالدٌ علمُهُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الغلط</span></td><td>The first expression was a mistake</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ زيدًا عمرًا،</span> when <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span> was a slip</td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل البعض</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الاشتمال</span> need a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> referring back to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبدل منه</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصفه، علمه</span></b>. That <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> can be omitted when understood. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على الناسِ حجُّ البيتِ مَنِ استطاعَ إليه سبيلًا</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> reading of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من استطاع</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منهم</span></b>. An omitted link must be recoverable.</p><p>For deliberate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فصيح</span> correction, use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ زيدًا بل عمرًا</span></b>. This is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل</span>, not the bare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الغلط</span> construction.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ الكتابَ نصفَهُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I read half the book.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة، مبدل منه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصف</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل بعض منصوب بالفتحة، وهو مضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه يعود إلى الكتاب</span>. The intended reading concerns half the book, not two separate things read.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يشترط</span></b> = is required; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرجع إلى</span></b> = refers back to; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحذف</span></b> = is omitted.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L4-s1", "title": "The intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "4G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> relationship.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b> names the same person as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخوك؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصفه</span></b> is a part of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمه</span></b> is associated with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> rather than an actual part<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمرًا</span></b> corrects a slip in the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الغلط</span> context.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أخوك خالد، وخالد مقصود بالحكم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الغلط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل البعض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت الكتاب نصفه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل البعض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعجبني خالد علمه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الاشتمال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف النسق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل البعض</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت زيدًا عمرًا، وذكر زيد كان خطأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الغلط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "4G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ الكتابَ نصفَهُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصف</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل بعض منصوب بالفتحة ومضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه عائد إلى الكتاب</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span> is intended for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصفه</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب ومبدل منه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل بعض منصوب بالفتحة وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل اشتمال مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به ثان مستقل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه يعود إلى الكتاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل يعود إلى القارئ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "4I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انتفعت بالمعلم علمه</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل اشتمال</span>. Choose its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضبط</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علمِه</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل اشتمال مجرور بالكسرة</span> following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّم المجرور بالباء. الهاء</span> returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّم</span>. Knowledge is associated with him; it is not an actual part in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل البعض</span> sense.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عِلْمِهِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عِلْمُهُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عِلْمَهُ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A speaker deliberately corrects the name in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت زيدًا ... عمرًا</span></b>. Choose the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فصيح</span> correction taught.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت زيدًا بل عمرًا</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف العطف بل</span>. The bare sequence without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الغلط</span> pattern, not the preferred deliberate correction.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "4R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "What distinguishes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت الكتاب نصفه</span></b> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت الكتاب كله</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصفه</span></b> selects an actual part as the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّه</span></b> confirms inclusion of the whole. An attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> alone does not determine the type of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابع</span>.</p>", "group": "4R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّه حرف عطف؛ نصفه نعت حقيقي</span>.", "Both must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل</span> because both contain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصفه بدل بعض؛ كلّه توكيد معنوي يشمل جميع الكتاب</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "4-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يشترط في بدل البعض والاشتمال ضمير يرجع إلى المبدل منه، وقد يحذف</span>.</b> What does the final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> permit?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقد يحذف</span></b> permits an understood link. In the taught <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> reading of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من استطاع</span></b> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الناس, تقدير</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منهم</span></b> supplies the reference. It does not remove the need for that reference.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Making every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>.", "Eliminating every connection to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبدل منه</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الضمير إذا كان مفهومًا، مع بقاء العلاقة بالمبدل منه</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "5", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span> and the replacement test", "short": "Lesson 5", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s1\">Clarify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابع</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>. It clarifies a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> or narrows a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موضّح للمعارف، مخصّص للنكرات</span></b>. It is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد غير مؤوّل</span></b> here, unlike a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد</span> interpreted as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشتق</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span> is called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف عليه</span></b>.</p><p>In the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span> reading of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أخوك خالدٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> clarifies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخوك</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span> remains directed to the first expression. In a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> reading, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> is itself <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصودًا بالحكم</span>. Most expressions allowing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span> also allow <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل</span>. The boundary is subtle; the visible wording alone often does not determine a unique label.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إحلال البدل محل المبدل منه</span></h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> involves intended replacement: ask whether the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> can occupy the place of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المبدل منه. عطف البيان</span> does not require this replacement.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا زيدُ الحارثُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارث</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف بيان</span> in the displayed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>. Ordinary direct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء</span> does not allow <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا الحارثُ</span></b>; this blocks the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> account here. Recall that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى مبني على الضم في محل نصب</span>; this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابع</span> follows its expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضم</span>.</p><p>A further example is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا ابنُ التاركِ البكريِّ بشرٍ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التارك</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span>, in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البكري مضاف إليه</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشر عطف بيان له</span>. Replacing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البكري</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشر</span> would give <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاركِ بشرٍ</span></b>, which violates this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> pattern: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد اسم فاعل</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> cannot here be added to that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منوّن اسم</span>. Preserve the distinction between valid <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توضيح</span> and invalid replacement.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s3\">Worked relationship</h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءَ أخوكَ خالدٌ</span></b> <span class=\"gl\">use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span>.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخو</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو، وهو مضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف بيان مرفوع بالضمة، موضّح لأخوك</span>. In a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> selecting <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل</span>, change that last label and its account of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span>; do not claim both labels are simultaneously required.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاز</span></b> = is permitted; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكثر</span></b> means most, not all.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L5-s1", "title": "Clarify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إحلال البدل محل المبدل منه</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s3", "title": "Worked relationship"}], "items": [{"id": "5G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أخوك خالدٌ</span></b>, select the explanation required by the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span> account.", "sol": "<p>The question selects <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جامد</span> clarifying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخوك</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل</span> reading is often possible for the same wording, but has a different account of what is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصود بالحكم</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مقصود بالحكم على وجه البدل المطلوب هنا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد يوضّح أخوك؛ الحكم موجّه إلى المتبوع</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد نعت مشتق من فعل خالد</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أخوك خالدٌ</span></b> using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخو</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو ومضاف؛ الكاف مضاف إليه؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف بيان مرفوع بالضمة</span>. It clarifies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخوك</span> under the specified reading.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخو</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو ومضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالألف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل بعض منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف بيان مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارث</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا زيدُ الحارثُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف بيان</span> rather than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> in the construction taught?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> requires the intended replacement. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا الحارث</span></b> fails the ordinary direct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء</span> pattern here, whereas <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span> clarifies the already-called <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span>. The displayed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارثُ</span> follows the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضم</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحارث</span> is an actual part of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إحلاله محل زيد يعطي يا الحارث، وهو غير جائز في هذا النداء المباشر</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممنوع من الجر</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا ابن التارك البكريِّ بشرٍ</span></b>, why does the stated account reject <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشر</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشرٍ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف بيان للبكري مجرور</span>. In this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد اسم فاعل التارك</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> cannot be added to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منوّن اسم بشر</span> by replacing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البكري</span>. That blocks this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> account.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["Replacing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البكري</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التارك بشرٍ</span>, which violates this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span> pattern.", "A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> can never have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابع</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشر</span> must be a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span> because it lacks <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> presents <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أخوك خالدٌ</span></b> with no stated intention. Which claim is sound?", "sol": "<p>This is one of the overlapping patterns. The same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> does not select between <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل</span>. The difference concerns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توضيح المتبوع</span> versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كون التابع مقصودًا بالحكم</span>.</p>", "group": "5R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["Any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> after another expression is automatically <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي</span>.", "Its ending proves only <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الغلط</span> is possible.", "It can allow <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل</span>; the intended account must be established."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "5-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكثر ما جاز أن يكون عطف بيان جاز أن يكون بدل الكل</span>.</b> Choose the accurate inference.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكثر</span></b> means most. The replacement test gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span> such as the taught <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة لفظية</span> examples. Neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> requires a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف بيان</span> is necessarily <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> with no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>.", "Most cases overlap, but <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إحلال</span> may block <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> in some cases.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span> always requires a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "6", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف النسق على اللفظ والمحل والمعنى</span>", "short": "Lesson 6", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s1\">Link with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العطف بحرف العطف</span></b> is also <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف النسق</span></b>. Identify <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف عليه، حرف عطف، معطوف</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ خالدًا وسعيدًا</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدًا</span> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span> does not make it a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. Recall the meanings of the individual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف: الواو</span> combines without itself specifying order; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثم</span> add their respective ordering meanings; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل</span> can correct an earlier expression.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s2\">Three accounts</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Account</th><th>Example</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف على اللفظ، وهو الأصل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس زيدٌ بقائمٍ ولا جالسٍ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جالس</span> follows the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائم</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف على المحل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس زيدٌ بقائمٍ ولا جالسًا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ليس منصوب محلًّا</span> despite <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء الزائدة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف على المعنى، أو على التوهّم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لستُ مدركَ ما مضى ولا سابقٍ شيئًا إذا كان جائيًا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سابقٍ</span> follows the possible wording <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمدركٍ</span>, although that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باء</span> is not expressed</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The last is a recognition pattern, not permission to invent a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> whenever an ending seems unexpected. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توهّم</span></b> here concerns an envisaged grammatical wording. In the poetic expression, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مدرك</span></b> = catching up with; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سابق</span></b> = getting ahead of. A possible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باء زائدة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ليس</span> explains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سابق</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليسَ خالدٌ بقائمٍ ولا جالسًا</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض ناقص؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ليس مرفوع؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر زائد؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ليس مجرور لفظًا منصوب محلًّا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لتأكيد النفي؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جالسًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف على محل قائم منصوب بالفتحة</span>. If <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جالسٍ</span> is chosen instead, the account is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف على اللفظ</span>. Both are available; a single-answer question must specify which is intended.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L6-s1", "title": "Link with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s2", "title": "Three accounts"}, {"id": "L6-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "6G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Name the three components of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ خالدًا وسعيدًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف عليه؛ الواو حرف عطف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف منصوب بالفتحة</span>. This <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> does not impose a chronological order by itself.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف عليه منصوب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باء زائدة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "6G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف على المحل</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس خالدٌ بقائمٍ ولا جالسًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء زائدة،</span> so <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائم</span></b> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب خبر ليس</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جالسًا</span></b> follows that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو للعطف ولا لتأكيد النفي</span>. The question deliberately selects this account rather than the equally available <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللفظ</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض ناقص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ليس منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لقائم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ليس مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ليس مجرور لفظًا منصوب محلًّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ليس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه بلا محل نصب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو ثم لا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرفا جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضميران في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف ثم لا لتأكيد النفي</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جالسًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف على اللفظ مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف على المحل منصوب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "6I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس حامدٌ بغائبٍ ولا <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b> using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف على اللفظ</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريضٍ</span></b> follows the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غائبٍ. مريضًا</span> would follow its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span>, a valid different account excluded by the question.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريضٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريضًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريضٍ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لستُ مدركَ ما مضى ولا سابقٍ شيئًا إذا كان جائيًا</span></b>, no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باء</span> appears before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مدرك</span>. What explains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سابقٍ</span> in the taught reading?", "sol": "<p>This is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف على المعنى أو التوهّم</span></b>: it follows the possible wording <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمدركٍ</span></b>. It does not follow an actually expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مدرك</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شيئًا</span> is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سابق</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف على المعنى؛ لو قيل بمدركٍ لجاز جرّه بالباء الزائدة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف على لفظ مدرك، وهو مجرور ظاهرًا بالفعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سابق مضاف إليه لشيئًا</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "6R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس زيد بقائم ولا جالسٍ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس زيد بقائم ولا جالسًا</span></b> both possible?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائمٍ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر لفظي</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء الزائدة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب محلّي</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ليس</span>. The two endings on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جالس</span> correspond to those two different bases for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span>.</p>", "group": "6R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["The first follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللفظ</span> and the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحل</span>.", "The ending of every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابع</span> is optional without a reason.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جالس</span> is always <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> regardless of the ending."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "6-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العطف على اللفظ هو الأصل</span>.</b> Which example uses that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأصل</span>?", "sol": "<p>Only the first follows the actual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قائم</span>. The second follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل النصب</span>, and the third follows the envisaged wording with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باء</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس زيد بقائمٍ ولا جالسًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس زيد بقائمٍ ولا جالسٍ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لست مدركَ ما مضى ولا سابقٍ، على توهّم الباء</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "7", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العطف على الضمير</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قطع</span>", "short": "Lesson 7", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s1\">Two restrictions</h2><p>When joining an expression to a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مرفوع متصل</span></b>, first reinforce that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> with a matching <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذهبتُ أنا وخالدٌ</span></b>. The rule also covers the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اذهبْ أنتَ وأخوكَ</span></b>. The reinforcement is unnecessary if there is a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاصل</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُهُ وخالدٌ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span> separates the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل</span> from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف</span>. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span>, the meaning is that Khalid also performed the action.</p><p>When joining to a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مجرور متصل</span></b>, repeat the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف الجر</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بكَ وبخالدٍ</span></b>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لها وللأرضِ</span></b>. Do not treat a nearby <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> as proof that it is joined to the closest <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصدٌّ عن سبيلِ اللهِ وكفرٌ بهِ والمسجدِ الحرامِ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسجد</span> is connected to the earlier <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبيل</span></b> under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عن</span>, not to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">به</span>. The understood relationship is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صدّ عن المسجد الحرام</span>. Trace the meaning as well as the endings.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قطع للمدح أو الذم</span></h2><p>A following expression can be <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقطوعًا</span></b> from the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مدح</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذم</span></b>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">والموفون بعهدهم إذا عاهدوا والصابرين في البأساء والضراء</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصابرين</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب على المدح</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمدح الصابرين</span></b>; it is not a mistaken attempt to match <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الموفون</span>. This requires the intended construction, not an arbitrary change of ending.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذهبتُ أنا وخالدٌ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذهبْتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون؛ التاء فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل لتوكيد التاء، في محل رفع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف على التاء مرفوع بالضمة. أنا</span> supplies the required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> before this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span>; it is not a new <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> here.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجب إعادة</span></b> = repeating is required; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفصولًا</span></b> = separated by intervening wording.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L7-s1", "title": "Two restrictions"}, {"id": "L7-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قطع للمدح أو الذم</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "7G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> to the construction.", "sol": "<p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذهبت أنا وخالد</span></b> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منفصل</span> reinforces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمته وخالدٌ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span> separates that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف</span>, so the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منفصل</span> is not required for this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بك وبخالد</span></b> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باء</span> is repeated.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذهبتُ أنا وخالدٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل اشتمال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد المرفوع المتصل بمنفصل قبل العطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعادة حرف الجر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُه وخالدٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء فاصل يغني عن المنفصل في العطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مفعول به منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بك وبخالدٍ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت حقيقي للكاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد فاعل لمررت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعادة حرف الجر مع العطف على المجرور المتصل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اذهبْ أنتَ وأخوكَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اذهب</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على السكون، فاعله مستتر وجوبًا تقديره أنت؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد له في محل رفع؛ الواو حرف عطف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخو</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف على ذلك الفاعل مرفوع بالواو ومضاف؛ الكاف مضاف إليه</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منفصل</span> supports this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستتر</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اذهب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر مبني على السكون، وفاعله مستتر تقديره أنت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بلام مكتوبة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد للفاعل المستتر في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخو</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف على الفاعل المستتر مرفوع بالواو ومضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب توكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جواب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت به وخالدٍ</span></b> under the rule for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العطف على الضمير المجرور المتصل</span>.", "sol": "<p>Repeat the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف الجر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">به وبخالدٍ</span></b>. Merely changing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> to another ending does not satisfy the requested construction.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت به وبخالدٍ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت به وخالدُ، مع بقاء التحليل نفسه</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت به وخالدًا</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "7I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصدٌّ عن سبيل الله وكفرٌ به والمسجدِ الحرامِ</span></b>, use the taught connection for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسجد</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسجدِ</span></b> returns to the earlier <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبيلِ</span></b> governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عن</span>; its relationship is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صدّ عن المسجد</span>. It is not joined to the nearby <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">به</span>, so this example does not remove the repeated-<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار</span> rule.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف على الهاء في به بلا إعادة الجار</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف على سبيل؛ المعنى صدّ عن المسجد الحرام</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لكفر منصوب بالكسرة</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قطع للمدح</span> reading of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">والموفون ... والصابرين</span></b>, why is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصابرين منصوبًا</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصابرين</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب على المدح؛ تقدير العامل أمدح</span>. This is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قطع</span></b> from the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> for a reason, not unrestricted variation in the ending of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابع</span>.</p>", "group": "7R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بفعل محذوف تقديره أمدح، لا على متابعة رفع الموفون</span>.", "It is an accidental misspelling of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصابرون</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو حرف جر يوجب النصب</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "7-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا عطف على مرفوع متصل وجب توكيده بمنفصل إلا أن يكون مفصولًا</span>.</b> Which expression illustrates the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمته</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاصل</span> between <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span>. The second illustrates the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منفصل</span> requirement; the third is the separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> rule.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بك وبخالدٍ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذهبتُ أنا وخالدٌ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُه وخالدٌ</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "8", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأكيد اللفظي</span>", "short": "Lesson 8", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s1\">Reinforce what has been said</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأكيد</span></b> is also <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span></b>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤكَّد</span></b>. It reinforces what is attributed to that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span> or confirms inclusion of all its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفراد</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأكيد اللفظي</span></b> repeats an expression, or with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span> can repeat its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرادف</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>What is reinforced?</th><th>Pattern</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قامَ قامَ زيدٌ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء زيدٌ زيدٌ؛</span> or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرادف</span> used to reinforce, as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرجًا</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضيّقًا</span> in the selected account</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتَ أنتَ المقصودُ؛ إيّاكَ إيّاكَ أردتُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل مرفوع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذهبتُ أنا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل منصوب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُكَ أنتَ؛ أكرمتُكَ إيّاكَ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل مجرور</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بكَ أنتَ؛ مررتُ بكَ بكَ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The form <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span></b> does not make every occurrence a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> or impose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> on what it reinforces. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتك أنت</span> it reinforces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span>; in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بك أنت</span> it reinforces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جر</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمل</span></h2><p>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جواب غير عامل</span></b> can be repeated alone: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا لا أُشركُ باللهِ</span></b>. With other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف</span>, repeat the attached material too: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّكم إنّكم مخرجون</span></b>; do not use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ إنّ زيدًا قائمٌ</span></b> for this pattern.</p><p>A whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> can be repeated: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ مع العسر يسرًا. إنّ مع العسر يسرًا</span>.</b> Repetition may also be linked by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّا سيعلمون ثم كلّا سيعلمون</span></b>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأسيس أولى من التأكيد</span></b>: when context supports an independent new meaning, prefer it to treating wording as mere reinforcement. Not every neighbouring pair of related words is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>. In exercises, use the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> reading.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُكَ إيّاكَ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمْتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل في محل نصب توكيد لفظي للكاف</span>. There is one intended person receiving the action, not an additional <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعادة</span></b> = repetition; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرادف</span></b> = an expression with the same meaning.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L8-s1", "title": "Reinforce what has been said"}, {"id": "L8-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمل</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "8G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify the expression being reinforced in the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> reading.", "sol": "<p>The repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل، ضمير، جار ومجرور</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جواب</span> supply <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي</span> in these stated readings. Repetition does not introduce an additional <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قام قام زيد: قام الثانية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل جديد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي للفعل الأول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت أنت المقصود: أنت الثانية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي للضمير الأول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بك بك: بك الثانية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل بعض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لمررت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعادة الجار والمجرور للتوكيد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا لا أشرك بالله: لا الثانية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي لحرف الجواب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناصبة للجنس</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "8G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُكَ إيّاكَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمْتُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون والتاء فاعل؛ الكاف مفعول به في محل نصب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي للكاف في محل نصب</span>. The same person is intended by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر والتاء مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل في محل نصب توكيد لفظي للكاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به ثان مستقل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "8I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Use the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> reading of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بك أنت</span></b>. What is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span></b> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منفصل</span> form used to reinforce <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف المجرورة</span>. Its form does not force a new <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> analysis; in the stated account its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع مبتدأ بالضرورة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر توكيد للكاف</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مفعول به ثان</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the correct repetition pattern with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> and its attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.", "sol": "<p>Repeat what is attached to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> as well: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّكم إنّكم</span></b>. Bare repetition such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ إنّ زيدًا قائم</span> is excluded by this rule.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ إنّكم مخرجون</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّكم إنّكم مخرجون</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ إنّ زيدًا قائمٌ</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In a reading where <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرجًا</span></b> repeats the meaning of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضيّقًا</span></b>, which statement fits?", "sol": "<p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span> can be reinforced by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرادف</span>. The specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> account of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضيّقًا حرجًا</span> illustrates this; the principle <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأسيس أولى من التأكيد</span></b> prevents treating every meaningful addition as mere repetition.</p>", "group": "8R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["Every related pair of words must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> even if the second adds a new meaning.", "Only identical spelling can ever give <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي بمرادف؛ ومع معنى جديد واضح يكون التأسيس أولى</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "8-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكون التأكيد اللفظي في الجملة بإعادة الأولى، وقد يكون بثمّ</span>.</b> Which statement follows?", "sol": "<p>The rule includes repeating a whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>, as in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ مع العسر يسرًا</span></b> repeated, and the pattern <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّا سيعلمون ثم كلّا سيعلمون</span></b>. Identify repetition and intended meaning together.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["A repeated whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> may supply <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>, including the taught pattern with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثمّ</span>.", "Whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمل</span> cannot be repeated for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثمّ</span> makes every later <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "9", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأكيد المعنوي</span> and its forms", "short": "Lesson 9", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s1\">A matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأكيد المعنوي</span></b> uses specified words: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس، عين، كلا، كلتا، كلّ</span></b>. They are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> matching the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤكَّد</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الأميرُ نفسُهُ</span></b>, which confirms that the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمير</span> himself came, with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الرجالُ كلُّهم</span></b>, which includes every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فرد</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤكَّد</span></th><th>Suitable forms</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد مذكر أو مؤنث</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسُه، عينُه؛ نفسُها، عينُها</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى مذكر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما؛ أنفسُهما، أعينُهما</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى مؤنث</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتاهما؛ أنفسُهما، أعينُهما</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مذكر أو مؤنث</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنفسُهم، أعينُهم؛ أنفسُهنّ، أعينُهنّ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنفس وأعين</span></b> for both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>, with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> identifying the intended number. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتا</span></b> are specifically for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span>. With their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>, use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف في الرفع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء في النصب والجر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الرجلان كلاهما؛ رأيت الرجلين كليهما؛ مررت بالبنتين كلتيهما</span></b>.</p><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> follows its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤكَّد</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ الرجالَ كلَّهم</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بالرجالِ كلِّهم</span></b>. A matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> alone is insufficient: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلُّهم حاضرٌ</span></b> begins with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span>; there is no preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤكَّد</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل</span> to follow.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ البنتَيْنِ كِلْتَيْهِما</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I saw both girls.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البنتين</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالياء لأنه مثنّى</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتي</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي منصوب بالياء لإلحاقه بالمثنّى، وهو مضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه مطابق للمؤكَّد</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> confirms both, rather than selecting one part as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل البعض</span> would.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L9-s1", "title": "A matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "9G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> form matching the given <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤكَّد</span>.", "sol": "<p>Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنفس وأعين</span></b> with both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> distinguishes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتاهما</span></b> suits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤنث المثنّى المرفوع</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتيهما</span> is for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الرجلان: نفس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنفسُهنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسُه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنفسُهما</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءت البنات: عين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عينُه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعينُهما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعينُهنّ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءت البنتان: كلتا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتيهما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتاهما</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "9G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ البنتين كلتيهما</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البنتين</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالياء؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتي</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي منصوب بالياء لإلحاقه بالمثنّى ومضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه. رأيت فعل ماض والتاء فاعل</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> includes both girls.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البنتين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالياء لأنه مثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي منصوب بالياء، ملحق بالمثنّى، وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل البعض مجرور</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه مطابق للمؤكَّد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "9I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكمل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بالمعلّمين <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقصود مثنّى مذكر، والتوكيد بكلا</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كليهما</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي مجرور بالياء؛ مؤكَّده المعلّمَيْن مثنّى مذكر. كلاهما</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتيهما</span> has the wrong <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير أو تأنيث</span> for the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤكَّد</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كليهما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتيهما</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قارن</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر القوم كلهم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">و</span><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلهم حاضر</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر التحليل الصحيح لكلمة كل</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّهم</span></b> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القوم</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> in the first. In the second, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ</span></b> begins the construction as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاضر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>; there is no earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤكَّد</span> for it to follow.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد في الأولى، ومبتدأ في الثانية</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به في الأولى وحرف في الثانية</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد في الجملتين دائمًا</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "9R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت الرجال <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b> to confirm that every one was seen.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلَّهم</span></b> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجال المنصوب</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي منصوب بالفتحة؛ كل مضاف وهم مضاف إليه</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> is determined by its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤكَّد</span>, not by the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> alone.</p>", "group": "9R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلُّهم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلَّهم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلِّهم</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألفاظ التأكيد المعنوي تضاف إلى ضمير مطابق للمؤكَّد</span>.</b> Which pairing satisfies this rule?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنفسهما</span></b> uses the required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنفس</span> form with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> and the matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما. أنفسهم</span> fails the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> reference; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسه</span> fails the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span> reference.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجال نفسه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البنتان أنفسهم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البنتان أنفسهما</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "10", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> and extensions of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>", "short": "Lesson 10", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عين</span></h2><p>Before reinforcing a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مرفوع متصل</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عين</span>, first give <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي</span></b> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منفصل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قمتُ أنا نفسي</span></b>. This also applies to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستتر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأميرُ ينظّفُ المسجدَ هو نفسُهُ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> reinforces the hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسه</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاصل</span> alone does not replace this requirement.</p><p>When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عين</span> occur together, put <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span> first: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء زيدٌ نفسُهُ عينُهُ</span></b>. They can also take <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باء زائدة</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الرجلُ بنفسِهِ</span></b>. In this specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> account, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمع</span> and its family</h2><p>Recognise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمع، جمعاء، أجمعون، جُمَع</span></b>. These can supply <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> without the attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> required by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل</span>. They may strengthen <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فسجد الملائكةُ كلُّهم أجمعون</span></b>. They can also appear without it: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأغوينّهم أجمعين</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمعين</span> follows the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Pattern</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الجيشُ أجمعُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمعاء</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءت القبيلةُ جمعاءُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمعون</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الرجالُ أجمعونَ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُمَع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءت القبائلُ جُمَعُ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكتع، أبصع</span></b> are further <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألفاظ</span> to recognise in the vocabulary of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>; the productive practice here uses the fully established patterns above.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s3\">Meaning does not determine the label alone</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جميعًا</span></b> can reinforce inclusion in meaning while being <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حالًا مؤكِّدة</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الرجالُ جميعًا</span></b>. Do not relabel it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيدًا تابعًا</span> just because its meaning resembles <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلهم</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قامَ الرجالُ كلُّهم أجمعونَ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قام</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجال</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي مرفوع بالضمة وهو مضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمعون</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي مرفوع بالواو،</span> strengthens the inclusion already expressed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلهم</span>. Contrast <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قام الرجال جميعًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جميعًا حال مؤكّدة منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L10-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عين</span>"}, {"id": "L10-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمع</span> and its family"}, {"id": "L10-s3", "title": "Meaning does not determine the label alone"}, {"id": "L10-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "10G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Reinforce <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قمتُ</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span> using the required sequence.", "sol": "<p>First give the matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منفصل</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا</span></b>, then <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسي</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس توكيد معنوي مرفوع بضمة مقدّرة قبل ياء المتكلم، وهو مضاف والياء مضاف إليه</span>. The required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي</span> precedes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قمتُ نفسي، بلا توكيد لفظي</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قمتُ نفسُه</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قمتُ أنا نفسي</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "10G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قام الرجالُ كلُّهم أجمعون</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قام</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والرجال فاعل مرفوع؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي مرفوع ومضاف، هم مضاف إليه؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمعون</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي مرفوع بالواو</span> strengthens the inclusion. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمعون</span> does not require an attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرجال</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي مرفوع بالضمة ومضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جواب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لكانت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت منصوب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمعون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب بالواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي مرفوع بالواو</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "10I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكمل بالترتيب المقرّر عند اجتماع نفس وعين</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر خالدٌ <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p>Put <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسه</span></b> before <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عينه</span></b>. Both follow <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد المرفوع</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>, so both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعان بالضمة؛</span> each is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسُه عينُه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عينُه نفسُه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسَه عينِه</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "10I-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر الإعراب وفق الوجه المذكور</span>.", "sol": "<p>Under the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باء زائدة</span> account, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span></b> follows the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع محل</span> of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤكَّد</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جميعًا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مؤكّدة منصوب بالفتحة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمعين</span></b> follows the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي منصوب بالياء</span>; it is not governed by the initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الرجل بنفسه، والباء زائدة للتوكيد: نفس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب محلًّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستقل غير تابع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الرجال جميعًا: جميعًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد تابع مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مؤكّدة منصوب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأغوينّهم أجمعين: أجمعين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور باللام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي منصوب بالياء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "10R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمير ينظّف المسجد هو نفسه</span></b>, why is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> included before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسه</span>?", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ينظّف</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره هو</span>. The expressed <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span></b> reinforces it before <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسه</span></b>, satisfying the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس/عين</span> rule even though <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسجد</span> already separates the expressions.</p>", "group": "10R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لتوكيد الفاعل المستتر لفظيًّا قبل توكيده بنفس</span>.", "Because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسجد</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مجرور</span>.", "Because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسه</span> must always be a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "10-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تؤخّر عين عن نفس إن اجتمعتا</span>.</b> Which further distinction is accurate?", "sol": "<p>Meaning alone is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلهم</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابع</span> in the specified construction; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جميعًا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مؤكّدة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمعون</span></b> belongs to the additional <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> family and can appear without a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جميعًا</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعًا</span> because it means inclusion.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّهم توكيد تابع؛ جميعًا حال مؤكّدة في جاء الرجال جميعًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجمعون</span> always requires a following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "11", "title": "Following a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> and recognising <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>", "short": "Lesson 11", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s1\">Three places to look</h2><p>When a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span> has both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب لفظي</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب محلّي</span>, its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابع</span> may follow either where the construction permits. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما أنا بكاذبٍ ولا خادعٍ</span></b> with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب محلًّا</span> account of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ليس</span> practised earlier.</p><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هل من خالقٍ غيرُ اللهِ يرزقكم</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من زائدة؛ خالق مجرور لفظًا مرفوع محلًّا على الابتداء؛ غيرُ</span> follows that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> account. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الله مضاف إليه</span>. Do not turn <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غيرُ</span> into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غيرِ</span> merely because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالقٍ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>.</p><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابع</span> can also follow the earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> before a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناسخ</span> entered. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنّ اللهَ بريءٌ من المشركين ورسولُهُ</span></b>, the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> account makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسولُه تابعًا</span> to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الله</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنّ: رفع بالابتداء</span>. This is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطفًا</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشركين</span> and does not make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسول</span> part of the meaning “free from.” Treat this as a specified construction, not unrestricted permission to ignore <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نواسخ</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s2\">Beyond <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التوابع: اسم الفعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفعل</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الفعل</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير معمول</span> in this classification, although it can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عاملًا</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلمَّ شهداءَكم</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلم اسم فعل أمر، شهداء مفعول به، كم مضاف إليه. عامل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span> are different questions.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفعل</span>, when <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>, is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول بالأصالة</span></b> here. Classify its own <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> rather than labelling it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمولًا بالتبعية</span> because it is repeated or joined in wording.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Construction</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبُ خالدٌ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع، خالٍ من ناصب وجازم</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أريدُ أن يكتبَ خالدٌ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتب مضارع منصوب بأن</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبْ خالدٌ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بلم</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن أحسنتَ أحسنَ اللهُ إليكَ</span></td><td>both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال ماضية مبنية في محل جزم</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> construction</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبَ خالدٌ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني، غير معمول</span> when free of a governing construction</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر بالصيغة، مبني وغير معمول</span> in the account used here</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِيكتبْ؛ لا تكسلْ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر باللام ونهي؛ مضارعان مجزومان</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>An alternative account treats <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر بالصيغة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم</span>; keep it separate from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> analysis used in these exercises. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span></b> does not prevent a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> when a governing construction supplies one.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ أحسنتَ أحسنَ اللهُ إليكَ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط جازم؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحسنت</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون في محل جزم فعل الشرط، والتاء فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحسن</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح في محل جزم جواب الشرط؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الله</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر؛ الجار والمجرور متعلّق بأحسن</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> keep their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> while taking the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L11-s1", "title": "Three places to look"}, {"id": "L11-s2", "title": "Beyond <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التوابع: اسم الفعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفعل</span>"}, {"id": "L11-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "11G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the basis of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تبعية</span> in the specified accounts.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خادعٍ</span></b> follows expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غيرُ</span></b> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع خالق</span> in the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> account. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسولُه</span></b> follows the earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الله</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنّ</span> in the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> account, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المشركين</span>.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما أنا بكاذبٍ ولا خادعٍ: خادع</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على محل قبل الناسخ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على اللفظ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلا علاقة بما قبله</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هل من خالقٍ غيرُ الله: غير، على النعت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على محل خالق المرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على لفظ خالق المجرور</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنّ الله بريء من المشركين ورسولُه: رسول، على العطف المذكور</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على لفظ المشركين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على المحل قبل دخول الناسخ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بأنّ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "11G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ أحسنتَ أحسنَ اللهُ إليكَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> keep their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> but are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم</span> under <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن الشرطية</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحسنت فعل الشرط</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحسن جواب الشرط. التاء فاعل الأول؛ الله فاعل الثاني؛ إلى حرف جر والكاف مجرورة محلًّا، والجار والمجرور متعلّق بأحسن</span>.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ الناسخة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط جازم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحسنت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على السكون في محل جزم فعل الشرط، والتاء فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض لا محل له هنا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحسن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على الفتح في محل جزم جواب الشرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الله</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إليك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى فعل والكاف فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى حرف جر والكاف في محل جر، متعلّق بأحسن</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "11I-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيّن حكم الفعل. استعمل وجه بناء الأمر بالصيغة</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span> when no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span> enters<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن يقرأَ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يقرأْ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِيقرأْ</span></b> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزومان</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اقرأْ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر بالصيغة مبني على السكون وغير معمول</span> in the account requested.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأ خالد: يقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع لخلوّه من الناصب والجازم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يريد أن يقرأ: يقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بأن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يقرأ: يقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض غير معمول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بلم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بلم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر بالصيغة مبني غير معمول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليقرأ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل غير معمول بلا جازم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بلام الأمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر بالصيغة مبني على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "11I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حلّل</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلمّ شهداءكم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وفق تقسيم معمول وغير معمول</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلمّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل أمر بمعنى أحضروا، غير معمول</span> in this classification, yet <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شهداءَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول به المنصوب. شهداء مضاف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم مضاف إليه</span>. Being <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> does not entail being <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معمول</span>.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلمّ اسم فعل غير معمول لكنه عامل؛ شهداء مفعول به وكم مضاف إليه</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير معمول</span> means it cannot govern any other word.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلمّ مفعول به لأنه اسم؛ شهداء فاعل</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "11R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر العبارة الصحيحة في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب خالد؛ إن أحسنت أحسن الله إليك</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب</span></b> is free of a governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> construction here. Under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحسنت وأحسن</span></b> retain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> while occupying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جزم</span>. Do not confuse the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> with absence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.</p>", "group": "11R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب ماض غير معمول هنا؛ أحسنت وأحسن مبنيّان في محل جزم</span>.", "A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> can never occupy a grammatical <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم لفظًا بالسكون</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "11-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يكون الفعل معمولًا إلا بالأصالة. والأمر باللام والنهي مجزومان</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر المثال الذي فيه مضارع مجزوم</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكسلْ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناهية الجازمة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بالسكون. اكتب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر بالصيغة مبني</span> in the chosen account; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني</span>. Similar-looking <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> does not establish the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبَ خالدٌ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْ، على وجه البناء</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكسلْ، على النهي</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "R", "title": "Module review: establish every relationship", "short": "Module review", "html": "<p>For each passage, identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>, what follows directly, and what follows through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تبعية</span>. Follow the analysis requested. The final tasks use fewer vowel marks and less English support.</p>", "secs": [], "items": [{"id": "A1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match all five <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التوابع</span>. Use the stated intention for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>.", "sol": "<p>The five relations are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت، بدل، عطف بيان، معطوف بحرف العطف، توكيد</span></b>. They all receive <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> through a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span>, but their meaning and connecting structure differ. The stated intention makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد عطف بيان</span> here.</p>", "group": "A|Distinguish the relationships", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء رجل صالح: صالح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت الكتاب نصفه: نصف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف بيان</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أخوك خالد، للتوضيح لا لقصد الحكم بخالد: خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت مشتق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف بيان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل في الوجه المختار</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالد وسعيد: سعيد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل اشتمال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف بحرف العطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الرجال كلهم: كل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "A2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A learner says “Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابع</span> copies all four dimensions of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النعت الحقيقي</span>.” Choose the correction.", "sol": "<p>The four-dimension rule belongs to ordinary <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت حقيقي</span></b>, not every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تابع</span>. For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سببي</span>, look also at the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span> and its returning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير. عطف، بدل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> each have their own <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Distinguish the relationships", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سببي</span> follows its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب وتعريف أو تنكير</span>; other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التوابع</span> have their own <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>.", "Correct: every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span> must have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span>.", "Correct: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد وسعاد</span> must have identical <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير وتأنيث</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "A3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر العبارة التي تجمع العلاقة والعلامة الصحيحتين</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بالطالبين كليهما</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، والمراد اثنان</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كليهما</span></b> confirms both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبين</span>. It follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> and uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملحق بالمثنّى</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. It is not selecting a part.</p>", "group": "A|Distinguish the relationships", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلي توكيد معنوي مجرور بالياء، وهو مضاف وهما مضاف إليه</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاهما هو الضبط اللازم بعد مجرور</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلي بدل بعض منصوب بالفتحة</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "B1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحّح النعت الحقيقي</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت البنتين الصالحتان</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصالحتين</span></b> agrees in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب، تعريف، تأنيث</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تثنية</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة النصب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span>, like <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البنتين</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت البنتين الصالحين</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت البنتين الصالحتين</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت البنتين الصالحةُ</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "B2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكمل على المحل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس الضيف بغائبٍ ولا <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريضًا</span></b> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب خبر ليس. مريضٍ</span> is available on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللفظ</span>, but the question explicitly selects <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحل</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريضٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريضٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريضًا</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "B3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر التصحيح بحسب الشرط المذكور</span>.", "sol": "<p>Repeat <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> with the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مجرور</span>; reinforce <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل</span> first with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسي</span>; place <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عين</span> and preserve <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالد نفسه عينه</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العطف على الكاف المجرورة: مررت بك ... سعيدٍ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وبسعيدٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وسعيدٍ بلا إعادة الباء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وسعيدًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد التاء بنفس: قمتُ</span> ...", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسي بلا منفصل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا نفسي</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجمع بين نفس وعين: جاء خالد</span> ...", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسُه عينُه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عينُه نفسُه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسَه عينِه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "C1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر المعلّمُ نفسُهُ. قرأتُ كتابَهُ نصفَهُ. ثم سلّمتُ عليه وعلى طالبٍ مجتهدٍ</span>.</b> In the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>, use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل البعض</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصفه</span>. Match the relationships.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والمعلّم فاعل؛ نفسه توكيد مرفوع ومضاف والهاء مضاف إليه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل؛ كتابه مفعول به ومضاف والهاء للمعلّم؛ نصفه بدل بعض منصوب والهاء للكتاب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف؛ سلّمت فعل ماض والتاء فاعل؛ عليه جار ومجرور؛ الواو للعطف وعلى مكرّرة، طالب مجرور ومجتهد نعت مجرور</span>. The two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاءات</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابه نصفه</span> do not have the same reference.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفسه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي للمعلّم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لحضر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل البعض</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب ومضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء في كتابه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لقرأت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه يعود إلى المعلّم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير يعود إلى نصف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل بعض منصوب ومضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء في نصفه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير يعود إلى المعلّم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف زائد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه يعود إلى الكتاب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على الثانية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعادة الجار مع العطف على الضمير المجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناسخ يرفع اسمًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجتهد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لطالب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت حقيقي مجرور لطالب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "C2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت برجل صالح أبوه. أكرمته أنا وخالد</span>.</b> Analyse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صالح</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سببي</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> as sharing the action of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمت</span>. Supply the full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل؛ الباء حرف جر ورجل مجرور، والجار والمجرور متعلّق بمررت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صالحٍ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبوه</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل له مرفوع بالواو، أبو مضاف والهاء للرجل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمته</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض والتاء فاعل والهاء مفعول به؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد للتاء؛ الواو عاطفة و</span><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف على التاء</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء</span> provides a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاصل</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا</span> is permissible reinforcement rather than necessary solely to license this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون والتاء فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض بلا فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">برجل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء حرف جر ورجل مجرور، متعلّق بمررت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء حرف نصب ورجل مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صالح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت سببي مجرور بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت حقيقي منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبو</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لصالح مرفوع بالواو وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به لصالح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت ثان لرجل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء في أبوه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستقل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه يعود إلى رجل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر والفاعل خالد وحده</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون والتاء فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء في أكرمته</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ لجملة جديدة في الوجه المطلوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي للتاء في محل رفع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو وخالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو حرف جر وخالد مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو حرف عطف وخالد معطوف على التاء مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "C3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عاد المسافرون كلهم. سلّمت عليهم وعلى أخيك. ثم عادوا جميعًا إلى البيت</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر الإعراب</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلهم</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسافرون المرفوع؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخي</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بعلى بالياء ومضاف والكاف مضاف إليه</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عادوا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جميعًا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مؤكّدة منصوب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى البيت</span></b> relates to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عادوا</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت مجرورًا بالكسرة</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلهم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل بعض مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد معنوي مرفوع؛ هم مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال منصوب؛ هم فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخيك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخي مجرور بعلى بالياء ومضاف؛ الكاف مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو في عادوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جميعًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد مرفوع بالواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مؤكّدة منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بإلى بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه لواو الجماعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مؤخّر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "D1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التابع ما يعمل فيه العامل بواسطة متبوعه</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما العبارة الموافقة؟</span>", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت</span></b> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلًا</span> directly; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صالحًا</span></b> receives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> through following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت. التبعية</span> explains the route of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>; it is not a fourth <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> or an automatic <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل تابع مجرور وإن كان متبوعه منصوبًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في رأيت رجلًا صالحًا: صالح نعت منصوب، والعمل فيه بواسطة رجل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التابع لا علاقة له بعامل المتبوع</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "D2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البدل مقصود بالحكم، وعطف البيان موضّح لمتبوعه</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ نتيجة صحيحة؟</span>", "sol": "<p>The same expression may allow both accounts. Establish intention and check whether replacement is possible. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل</span> shares the same referent as its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متبوع</span>, while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span> requires no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل الكل لا يوافق متبوعه في المدلول</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل عطف بيان مسبوق بالواو</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يحتمل اللفظ الواحد الوجهين، فيعيّن المقصود أو يختبر الإحلال</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "D3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حدّد معمولًا أو غير معمول بحسب الوجه المقرّر، مع التمييز بين اللفظ والمحل</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلمّ</span></b> shows that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير معمول</span> may still be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عاملًا</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحسنت</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جزم</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكسلْ</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناهية</span>, and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر بالصيغة مبني</span> in the requested account. Keep each analysis internally consistent.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هلمّ في هلمّ شهداءكم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم غير عامل ولا معمول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل غير معمول، عامل فيما بعده</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحسنت في إن أحسنت أحسن الله إليك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مجزوم لفظًا بالسكون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني في محل جزم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكسل، للنهي: تكسل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبني</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع معمول مجزوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر بالصيغة غير معمول</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتب، على وجه البناء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر بالصيغة غير معمول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}], "after": "<h2 class=\"sec\">Ready to continue?</h2><p>You should be able to distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر بالحرف</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر بالإضافة</span>; name all five <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التوابع</span>; explain the agreement and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير شروط</span>; distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللفظ، المحل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعنى</span>; and give a complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> without assigning a role from the ending alone. Revisit any rule whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> you could not explain, even if you guessed the correct choice.</p>"}], "revisit": "<ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر بالحرف، جر بالإضافة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللفظ</span> versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحل</span>: Lesson 1.</li><li>Forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت، حقيقي</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سببي،</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف المنعوت</span>: Lessons 2–3.</li><li>Types of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل،</span> the returning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف البيان</span>: Lessons 4–5.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللفظ، المحل، المعنى</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قطع</span>: Lessons 6–7.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد لفظي، توكيد معنوي</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال مؤكّدة</span>: Lessons 8–10.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحل قبل الناسخ، معمول</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير معمول</span>: Lesson 11.</li></ul>"};
